 "name": "Web Ecology Community Group",
 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2021-03-22",
 "description": "<p>The purpose of this group should be to discuss anything that could enhance the web and reduce its impact on environment. Discussion could be about, for example:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Improving efficiency of apis</li>\r\n<li>Reducing data consumption</li>\r\n<li>Upgrading apis to make them less greedy in energy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Millions of kilowatts are wasted in the world each year because of various reasons, such as:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bad algorithms</li>\r\n<li>Data storing (ex : spams)</li>\r\n<li>Wrong processes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Any idea that could make the web more respectful for environment is welcome to this group.</p>",
